      "description": "The meme implies that the patient's medical condition is being evaluated based on superficial appearance rather than objective clinical metrics, reinforcing a harmful anti-Black stereotype that reduces Black individuals to physical appearance. This can contribute to systemic racism in healthcare by normalizing biased perceptions.",
